{"title":"AoPS Math Club","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>AoPS Math Club is a group that organizes contests and also prepares users for competitions like MATHCOUNTS, AMC 8, AMC 10, and others. We are not affiliated with AoPS in any way, however, we do help people through AoPS forums and messaging.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Contests_hosted\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Contests hosted</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Where_is_our_website?\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Where is our website?</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#When_was_it_created?\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">When was it created?</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Who_created_it?\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Who created it?</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#How_was_it_created?\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">How was it created?</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Can_I_join?\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Can I join?</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Can_I_be_an_admin?\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Can I be an admin?</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Can_I_be_a_moderator?\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Can I be a moderator?</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Contests_hosted\">Contests hosted</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Math_Club&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Contests hosted\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>2017 AAMC</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\"Where_is_our_website.3F\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_is_our_website?\">Where is our website?</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Math_Club&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Where is our website?\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Our website is located at <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://aopsm.weebly.com/\">http://aopsm.weebly.com/</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"When_was_it_created.3F\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"When_was_it_created?\">When was it created?</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Math_Club&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: When was it created?\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>It was created in 2017.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Who_created_it.3F\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Who_created_it?\">Who created it?</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Math_Club&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Who created it?\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>AoPS user reddragon644 created it.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"How_was_it_created.3F\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_was_it_created?\">How was it created?</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Math_Club&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: How was it created?\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>It was originally a plan in making the excellent contest by iks92 and ItzVineeth. The idea died, as they had ran out of questions to use on the test. So, reddragon644 showed up and was like, why can't we make a contest just for AoPSers? Then there came the idea of AAMC.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Can_I_join.3F\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Can_I_join?\">Can I join?</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Math_Club&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Can I join?\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Sure! But, you must ask AoPS user reddragon644.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Can_I_be_an_admin.3F\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Can_I_be_an_admin?\">Can I be an admin?</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Math_Club&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Can I be an admin?\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Yes, if you are an active helper in competitions hosted by AoPS Math Club.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Can_I_be_a_moderator.3F\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Can_I_be_a_moderator?\">Can I be a moderator?</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Math_Club&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Can I be a moderator?\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Yes, if you are an active helper in competitions hosted by AoPS Math Club.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018073157\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.020 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 24/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:15572:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018073157 and revision id 86654. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}